Subject: [PATCH] Add a Tilla-style average spending summary to the home screen

Pin a full-width summary card to the bottom of the home screen, using the dark #1C222F / light #E5ECFA colours sampled from Tilla 2.8.1 over adb. The card has 8 dp top corners only, shows the total monthly spend of active subscriptions converted to week/month/year, and cycles the period on tap while persisting the existing average-expenses preference.
